sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuario
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant P as Planner(Orch.LLM)
  participant A1 as Investigador
  participant A2 as Escritor
  participant T as Tool(Serper)
  U->>O: run("preparar informe X")
  O->>P: "Divide en subtareas JSON"
  P-->>O: JSON plan (subtasks w/ ids, depends_on)
  O->>O: validar grafo (deps exist, no cycles)
  O->>A1: asigna subtareas R1,R2,R3
  A1->>T: buscar web (R1)
  T-->>A1: resultados R1
  A1-->>O: resultado R1a
  O->>A2: asigna tarea "redactar" con context = R1+R2+R3
  A2->>LLM: redactar informe
  A2-->>O: informe final
  O-->>U: resumen / informe